# Agent Digest Coverage Sync

## Rule

Every agent registered on `app.state` in `main.py` must have a corresponding entry in `agent_status_digest.py`. The digest is the system-wide health email sent 3x daily — an agent missing from it is invisible to monitoring.

## When Adding a New Agent

Update **both** files:

1. **`main.py`**: Register agent on `app.state`, add to `_service_checks`, add shutdown
2. **`agent_status_digest.py`**: Add the agent to the appropriate section

## Digest Sections (17 total, ~121 agents)

| Section | Method | Agents |
|---|---|---|
| Token Management | `_section_token_management` | Token Guardian, Renewal, Audit |
| SkyEye / Social | `_section_skyeye_social` | SkyEye Engine, Marketing Worker, Observer |
| Content Ops | `_section_content_ops` | ContentQueueJanitor |
| Token Lifecycle | `_section_token_lifecycle` | TokenLifecyclePredictor |
| Intelligence | `_section_intelligence` | Insight Accumulator, Web Reader, Night School |
| Clinical Safety | `_section_clinical_safety` | Therapeutic Integrity, Deadman, Recovery |
| Billing / Accounts | `_section_billing_accounts` | Billing Worker, Purge, Drip |
| Trust Auditors (22) | `_section_trust_auditors` | All 22 auditors |
| Trust Enforcer | `_section_trust_enforcer` | Trust Enforcer meta-agent |
| Coaching Subsystem | `_section_coaching_subsystem` | Community Mesh, Liminal, DOJO, Coaching Mesh, Call, Assessment |
| Liminal Presence | `_section_liminal_presence` | Silence Sentinel, Drift Monitor, Field Parser |
| Data Integrity | `_section_data_integrity` | Agent Status Digest (self) |
| Hive Workers | `_section_hive_defense_workers` | 16 Hive workers |
| App Workers | `_section_application_workers` | 23 application workers |
| DB Maintenance | `_section_db_maintenance` | DatabaseMaintenanceAgent |
| Infrastructure | `_section_infrastructure` | Swarm Relay, PostgreSQL, Redis |
| Hive Services | `_section_hive_defense_services` | 27 Hive defense services |

## How to Add

For background agents with `_running` flag, add to the matching section's list:

```python
("My New Agent", "my_new_agent"),  # app.state attribute name
```

For request-response services (no `_running`), use `_check_service()` instead of `_check_agent()`.

## Feb 2026 Incident

The digest reported 87/87 TRUSTED while 34 agents were missing entirely (21 auditors, Trust Enforcer, coaching engines, liminal presence agents). These agents could have failed with zero visibility in the health email.
